    "document": "BPP Legal Practice Course Programme Handbook 2017-18 (module list, credit values, assessment formats, classification scheme) combined with the standard LPC/SRA-outcomes-framework topic breakdown for each practice area's actual practical content (procedure, forms, professional conduct rules), as taught on any equivalent legal practice course of the period. BPP's own detailed module study materials and specific SRA outcome-by-outcome numbering below module level were not independently re-verified line-by-line, so this course invents its own stable id scheme per module (e.g. BLP-1 for Business Law and Practice topic 1) rather than reproducing any single provider's internal numbering, recorded honestly here.",
    "url": "https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/bppassets/public/assets/pdf/handbooks/LPC-Handbook-2017-18.pdf",
    "version": "Standard-topic itemisation compiled 2026-09-22 against the BPP 2017-18 handbook's module list and the SRA's live outcomes framework; below-module SRA outcome numbering not independently re-verified line by line.",
